  const commandAliases={campaign:"研究项目 项目 工作台",graph:"研究图谱 关系图",hypotheses:"假设",agents:"智能体 代理",evolution:"演化 群体 代际 胶囊",tasks:"任务 队列",runners:"执行节点 运行器",tools:"工具 能力",sentinel:"哨兵 监控 安全监控 AI Agent Security",events:"事件",incidents:"事件调查 事故",evidence:"证据",verification:"复验 验证",findings:"发现 可信结果",reports:"报告",runtime:"模型 路由",extensions:"扩展",settings:"设置"};
  const endpoints = {engagements:"/api/v1/engagements",tasks:"/api/v1/task-center",findings:"/api/v1/findings",readiness:"/api/v1/runtime/readiness",capabilities:"/api/v1/capabilities",orchestration:"/api/v1/orchestration/status",agentAudits:"/api/v1/agent-audit/audits",verification:"/api/v1/verification/receipts",runtimeConfig:"/api/v1/runtime/config",runtimeUsage:"/api/v1/runtime/usage",provider:"/api/v1/traditional/provider"};
